{"id":"f6a587dbcd36439d","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel.md","title":"Finite Acyclic Countermodels for K","display":"lem-k-acyclic-countermodel — Finite Acyclic Countermodels for K","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel","aliases":["89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel"],"display":"lem-k-acyclic-countermodel — Finite Acyclic Countermodels for K","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-k-acyclic-countermodel — Finite Acyclic Countermodels for K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\\nvdash A\">\\(\\mathrm K\\nvdash A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 为本书 Kripke 满足关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^+\">\\(R^+\\)</span> 为关系的正传递闭包；模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R,V\">\\(W,R,V\\)</span> 与指定世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 均在结论中一同存在量化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\neg(wR^+w)\\land (W,R,V),r\\not\\models A\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\neg(wR^+w)\\land (W,R,V),r\\not\\models A\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.146–147。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>来源证明将 GL 窗口种子改成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C,D_1,\\ldots,D_m\">\\(\\neg C,D_1,\\ldots,D_m\\)</span>，不复制正盒且不加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span>。每次窗口下降，公式的最大盒深度严格减少；命题展开有限，所以得到有限树。取直属窗口后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=S\">\\(R=S\\)</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^+\">\\(S^+\\)</span>，正/负盒真值引理直接成立。</p>\n<p>短证明接口依据原书 pp.146–147；本条没有另建 K 真值树的全部编码原子。有限无环框架可逆良基，但一般不传递。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K\\nvdash A","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"R^+","display":false},{"tex":"W,R,V","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k\\text{-}acyclic\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow\\exists W\\ \\exists R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\ \\exists V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\ \\exists r\\in W\\\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\neg(wR^+w)\\land (W,R,V),r\\not\\models A\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg C,D_1,\\ldots,D_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"R=S","display":false},{"tex":"S^+","display":false}],"bytes":1566,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9ab216026d4c49a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反模型：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel]]。命题优先条件及旧任意次序的反例：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。关系树与高度界：[[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]。K 的补充：[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-k-lob-rule]]。"}],"outgoing":["550226a6aaff441c","9f00301866fbd6f0","9cd755e57aea2c47","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00"]}